{"id":"vod_bf_36313","vodId":"36313","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"我的英雄学院第二季","name_cn":"我的英雄学院第二季","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-37/38e256a9c668aed9946802625cb20a8e.jpg"},"summary":"因偶然事件为契机与世界第一的英雄欧尔麦特相遇的“无个性”少年绿谷出久，身体内继承了欧尔麦特的个性，具有了成为英雄的资质。在经过严厉的训练后，绿谷出久成功进入了雄英高中入学，在与爆豪胜己、丽日御茶子等英雄科1年A班的同学们一起在互相切磋和学习中度过每一天。在这种情况下，全国瞩目的活动“雄英高中体育祭”来临了。目指第一的爆豪胜己，因为家族原因具有强烈意志的饭田天哉，为了否定父亲而渴求胜利的轰焦冻，以及英雄科1年B班的成员...。雄英高中所有同学都气志高涨，绿谷出久也重新下定了决心。“我也会全力去比赛的！“　　以最顶级的英雄为目标的学生们，“个性”、力量和自尊的战斗拉开了序幕！！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:48:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name"